    "parent_id": "512b187d-3509-4243-9f09-db68157be14d",
    "content": "# STRICTLY CONFIDENTIAL: Executive Compensation & Severance Schedules ## 1. Scope and Access Restrictions\nThis document contains sensitive material regarding executive leadership equity cliffs, severance multiplier formulas, and board-level change-of-control provisions.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "metadata": {
