    "parent_id": "512b187d-3509-4243-9f09-db68157be14d",
    "content": "Access is restricted strictly to C-Suite Officers (CEO, CFO, CTO) and Members of the Board of Directors. ## 2.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "metadata": {
      "doc_id": "8ff972c6-2643-4b6f-8484-49ea546eaacb",
